                                            <span class="action-card-title">🏆 職業運動員 Professional Athlete</span>
                                            <span class="action-card-limit">宗師級解鎖</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="action-card-desc">你嘅運動技能已達宗師級，獲選代表香港出賽！</p>
                                        <p class="action-card-effects cost">聲望 +8 · 健康 -4 · 壓力 +6 · 金錢 +$6,000~12,000 (隨機)</p>
                                        <button type="button" class="primary-button action-button" disabled="@(Session.State.HasFlag("action_pro_athlete") || Session.IsBusy)" @onclick="ProfessionalAthleteAsync">🏆 出賽 Compete</button>
                                    </div>
                                }
                            }
                        </div>
                    }
                    else if (_activeTab == "social")
                    {
                        <h4 class="section-title">👪 人際關係與社交 Socializing</h4>
